# Dev Container Standards

When handling dev-container-related work, first read:

`docs/devcontainer/devcontainer-standards.md`

Follow that English document as the authoritative source for dev container decisions.

Do not use Korean translations (`*.ko.md`) as AI rule sources. They exist only for human reading.

If the standard does not fit a project, document the exception in that project's `.devcontainer/README.md`.
